# Outfit body (R18): a rain poncho that flares from sloped shoulders to a wide round hem (a cone over the torso),
# accent hem band and front stripe, one glow stripe. Torso inside x 4..10, y 3..11 (pivot 7 7 0 on spine_03, hung
# lower than the vest).
name outfit_poncho
grid 5
size 14 14 12
slot cloth SwatchMain
slot hem SwatchAccent
slot glow SwatchGlow
cone 7 7 0 12 6.8 4.6 cloth
carve box 4 3 0 10 11 11
carve cyl 7 7 11 12 1.6
paint box 0 0 0 14 14 1 hem
paint box 6.5 0 0 7.5 14 12 hem
paint box 0 0 4 14 14 5 glow
pivot 7 7 0
